## Production code changes to revert

### 1. `SearchNearbyDeviceViewModel.kt`
- File:
  - `app/src/main/java/com/noisefit/ui/onboarding/pairing/find/SearchNearbyDeviceViewModel.kt`
- Current affected lines:
  - `31-74`
  - `283-287`
  - `404-417`

### 1.1 Remove added constants
